---
/**
 * Lead Magnet section - "soft conversion" for users not ready to buy
 * Offers a free Notion triage template as a downloadable resource
 */
---

<section class="relative py-20 border-t border-white/10 overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Background -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#0a0a0a]"></div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <!-- Text (Left) -->
      <div>
        <!-- Badge -->
        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-indigo-300 bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 rounded-full mb-6">
          Free Resource
        </span>

        <!-- Headline -->
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
          Not ready for a tool? Steal our manual system.
        </h2>

        <!-- Body -->
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          We built a Notion template to help you organize TestFlight screenshots and DMs before you're ready to automate them. It includes our Triage Protocol and email scripts.
        </p>

        <!-- CTA Button -->
        <a
          href="https://triage.illoominate.app"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 text-white font-semibold bg-zinc-800 hover:bg-zinc-700 border border-zinc-700 hover:border-zinc-600 rounded-xl transition-all duration-200 hover:translate-y-[-2px]"
        >
          Get the Triage Template
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Image (Right) -->
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="lead-magnet-img-container relative h-80 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/5">
          <img
            src="/images/triage-template-preview.png"
            alt="Notion triage template showing an organized Kanban board with Inbox, Triaging, and Shipped columns for managing user feedback"
            class="w-full h-auto object-cover object-left-top"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <!-- Bottom fade -->
          <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-24 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0a0a0a] to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
